      401         buf_ext-artic.cli-base-rate-rcv COLUMN-LABEL "Коэф. ед. пост.!в пост." FORMAT ">>,>>9.<<<<":U
      402       WITH NO-ROW-MARKERS SEPARATORS SIZE 88.88 BY 10.25 FIT-LAST-COLUMN.
      403   DEFINE FRAME Dialog-Frame
